---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Contact Baitaan: report an error or suggest a tool" description="Report a wrong result, suggest a tool for Mexico, Brazil or the Gulf, or ask about using a Baitaan calculator on your website.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Contact</h1>
    <p>Email <a class="text-link underline" href="mailto:hello@baitaandessigns.com">hello@baitaandessigns.com</a>. We read every message.</p>
    <p><a class="bt-btn bt-btn--sm" href="mailto:hello@baitaandessigns.com">Write to us</a></p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Report a wrong result</h2>
    <p>Tell us the page, the figures you entered, the result you got and the result you expected, with the reason if you have it (a law article, a payslip or an official calculator). We check it against the law, correct the page if needed and update its date.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Suggest a tool</h2>
    <p>Missing a calculation your country uses? Tell us what you need and which rules it follows. New tools are added when many people ask for the same thing.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Businesses and websites</h2>
    <p>You can link to any page freely. For an ad-free version of a calculator on your own site, or for anything else, write to the same address.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>We cannot give personal legal or tax advice, or represent you in a dispute.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
